      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I kept the small villain cards in my box because I find it nice to shuffle the stack of small villain cards (well, nicer than to shuffle the oversized cards...) to randomize setup. I&#39;m mildly disappointed that the two latest promo villains didn&#39;t came with a small card.</p><p>Do you intend to recreate the smaller version of the promo villains? If you have the art available, could I ask for it and make them myself? Or should I ask for those particular pieces of art directly to the GtG staff...? I could make them more broadly available as well if there is any interest (and if it doesn&#39;t infringe any rules or anything)...</p>",
